intro.body:
先看传统的数据驱动写法：先设计数据库表，代码围绕数据操作，业务规则散落在各处。

```python
class OrderDAO:
    def update_order_status(self, order_id, status):
        # 状态可以随意更新，没有业务规则保护
        db.execute("UPDATE orders SET status=? WHERE id=?", status, order_id)
```

再看 DDD 方式：先理解业务，代码直接表达业务语言，业务规则内聚在领域对象里。

```python
class Order:
    def confirm_payment(self, payment) -> None:
        """确认支付——只有待支付状态可以确认"""
        if self._status != OrderStatus.PENDING_PAYMENT:
            raise OrderException("只有待支付订单才能确认支付")
        self._status = OrderStatus.PAID
        self._record_event(PaymentConfirmed(self._id, payment))
    def cancel(self, reason: str) -> None:
        """取消订单——已发货不可取消"""
        if self._status in (OrderStatus.SHIPPED, OrderStatus.DELIVERED):
            raise OrderException("已发货或已完成的订单不可取消")
        self._status = OrderStatus.CANCELLED
```

第二段代码的优势：业务规则内聚在领域对象中，代码语言与业务语言一致，变更时只需修改对应的领域对象，不会牵一发动全身。

以退款流程为例，对比两种写法：

```python
# 语言脱节的写法：开发者自创词汇
class RefundService:
    def submit(self, order_id, amount, type):
        record = RefundRecord(order_id, amount, type, "WAIT")
        db.save(record)
    def process(self, record_id, approved):
        record = db.get(record_id)
        if approved:
            record.status = "OK"  # OK 是什么？
        else:
            record.status = "NO"  # NO 是什么？
# 统一语言的写法：直接反映业务词汇表
class RefundRequest:
    """退款申请"""
    def __init__(self, request_id, order, amount):
        self._status = RefundStatus.PENDING_REVIEW  # 待受理
    def accept(self, handled_by) -> None:
        """受理退款申请"""
        if self._status != RefundStatus.PENDING_REVIEW:
            raise RefundException("只有待受理状态的退款申请才能被受理")
        self._status = RefundStatus.ACCEPTED
        self._record_event(RefundAccepted(self._id))
    def reject(self, handled_by, reason: str) -> None:
        """拒绝退款申请"""
        if self._status != RefundStatus.PENDING_REVIEW:
            raise RefundException("只有待受理状态的退款申请才能被拒绝")
        self._status = RefundStatus.REJECTED
```
